VERIFICATION DEBT
Only two statements from one agency have been tried. A different agent's layout
is unproven, which is why the confirm gate in FR4 exists and why the figure is
not claimable until a human accepts it.

extractRentalStatementFields itself has no unit test — it is a live provider
call, which workflow.md forbids in the suite. The schema it is built on has 11
tests and the live path is covered by the script above.
